   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e468b84b-bd95-4554-82c8-dd3277964ee6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The implementation of random Forest had a overal difficulty of 60% dur to the earlier implementation of Decision Tree algorithm which followed similar procedure.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, Random forest being an ensemble of many decision trees, it has shown more accuracy than one decision tree we implemented earlier. this lab has therefore proved the importance of ensemble methods in improving accuracy of the prediction.\n",
    "\n",
    "After this lab, I am still continuing to explore deeper about decision trees and the application in the real life."
   ]
  },
